        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present to the market this superb 2 bed/2 bath apartment ideally positioned in The Academy Building within the highly sought-after Park West Pointe development.\nMeasuring approximately 77 sq.m, this spacious unit has been freshly painted throughout and comes to the market as a wonderful blank canvas, ready for its new owner to put their own stamp on it.\nThe well-proportioned accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, generous open-plan living/dining area, fully fitted kitchen, two spacious double bedrooms, family bathroom and master ensuite. The property benefits from excellent natural light, ample storage and a layout that is ideally suited to both first-time buyers and investors alike.\nThe well-established Park West development offers residents beautifully maintained communal grounds and excellent transport links. It is conveniently located close to the N4, M50 and Liffey Valley, while Dublin City Centre is readily accessible by car, bus and rail. Park West train station is within easy reach, providing a convenient commuter service into the city centre.\nAdditional Features:\n•c. 77 sq.m\n•BER B\n•2 bed / 2 bath\n•Management fee c. 2,385 per annum\n•Freshly painted throughout\n•Spacious and well-proportioned accommodation\n•Blank canvas ready for immediate occupation\n•Excellent transport links\n•Popular residential development\n•Ideal for first-time buyers and investors\n•Close to M50, N4 and Park West train station\nEarly viewing is highly advised to appreciate the size, condition and excellent location of this superb apartment. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing.\nDirections\nFrom the M50, take the N4 towards Dublin and exit at Park West. Continue towards Park West Business Campus and follow the signs for Park West Pointe. The Academy Building is located within the development.\n"
      },
